# Add your own .caddyfile files to this directory. They are imported at the top
# level of /etc/frankenphp/Caddyfile, so they can define extra site blocks.
# Use caddyfile-global.d/ for global options instead.
#
# This file only exists so the import glob matches something. Caddy logs
# "No files matching import glob pattern" on every start when a directory
# like this one is empty.
